abstract: >-
  An archive of Team Dirac's work on the degree-24 Inverse Galois Problem
  competition. Includes mathematical constructions, a submission corpus,
  selected verification records, a reproducible PARI/GP example, strategy
  handoffs, and an account of collaboration using GPT-5.6 Pro and Codex.
